  + 'a logo plate reading ULTRA-SATISFACTORY, companion app for Satisfactory, every recipe, one click apart, and four small scopes with yellow traces. '
  + 'Below: SONGNAME ULTRA-SATISFACTORY, unofficial fan project; SAMPLENAME and MACHINE, which step through real recipes (for example Reinforced Iron Plate, Assembler, 5 per minute, 12 second cycle, 15 MW); '
